{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：04:14 2026-10-23 HKT<br/>發佈時間：04:14 2026-10-23 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：04:14 2026-10-23 HKT</p><img alt=\"黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/31592eaf47b61d53135566f07f9d75eb/2026-10/2026-10-23_02_57_31_0.png\"/><p>乾燥的大陸氣流正為廣東帶來晴朗的天氣，沿岸地區風勢頗大。</p><p>在上午十時，強颱風薔琵集結在台北之東南約320公里，預料向西北偏北移動，時速約15公里，橫過台灣以東海域。</p><img alt=\"下午炎熱及非常乾燥。黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6c90754a577d122fd76c01f92ba2e8d5/2026-10/24_1.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8799ee4814f98f09770025c451e1b01a/2026-10/2026-10-23_02_56_31.png\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9237481c6c3c3c5ca19172b13dc73a11/2026-10/2026-10-23_02_56_39.png\"/><img alt=\"下午炎熱及非常乾燥。黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4e302b57f1773f92826ad900b77562d9/2026-10/22_6.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"下午炎熱及非常乾燥。黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6cfff628cb738f6da1413c7a199d0965/2026-10/23_2.jpeg\"/><p>本港地區今日陽光充沛。下午炎熱及非常乾燥。吹和緩至清勁北至西北風，離岸及高地吹強風。海有湧浪。</p><p>展望未來一兩日天晴及非常乾燥，部分地區酷熱，日夜溫差頗大。下週初部分時間有陽光。<br/> </p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T02:45:29.472534+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":254,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T20:14:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T03:18:31.542636+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T02:38:36.654038+00:00","content_hash":"ec41419616faaedbc86c60f0a4e83cba4f553c59e0b9a2cd1579fb54b611bfd5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}